# Powering Connectivity Across America

LCC Telecom provides fiber network and outside plant engineering services to telecom carriers across the USA.

## Our Services

### Fiber Network Design

LCC Telecom's Fiber Network Design services bridge the gap between concept and construction. Our engineers create detailed schematics and digital models of future fiber routes, factoring in terrain, existing infrastructure, and regulatory requirements. We produce permit packages, CAD drawings, and permit documentation needed for permitting and deployment.

### Field Engineering Services

LCC Telecom's Field Engineering Services bridge the gap between design and construction, ensuring seamless execution in the real world. Our certified engineers and technicians conduct site surveys, evaluate existing infrastructure, and capture critical field data. 

### Project & Program Management

LCC Telecom's Project & Program Management services provide end-to-end oversight for complex telecom deployments. From scoping and scheduling to resource allocation and risk management, our PMs keep projects on track, on budget, and aligned with stakeholder goals. 

### LCC Alexa

LCC Telecom has developed LCC Alexa, an innovative hands-free field application for OSP technicians. This AI-powered tool provides voice-enabled access to network infrastructure databases and enables real-time communication between field and design teams, reducing errors and accelerating timelines.

## Our Projects

[View All Projects](https://lcctelecom.com/projects/)

### Central Office Cabling

### FTTH and Aerial Fiber Deployment

### Municipal Broadband Planning

### MDU Fiber Deployment

## Why LCC Telecom?

**Experience** - Experienced engineers and technicians who specialize in OSP fiber networks.

**Innovation** - LCC Alexa integrates voice AI into fieldwork, enhancing efficiency and accuracy.

**Quality** - Rigorous QA/QC processes built into every phase of the project lifecycle.

**Value** - Scalable and cost-effective solutions tailored to your project needs.

