# Projects

LCC Telecom is committed to delivering high quality fiber network and outside plant engineering services to major telecom carriers across the USA.

## Central Office Cabling

LCC Telecom successfully cabled a major Central Office to support a large ISP buildout. We coordinated with the carrier's infrastructure and operations team to ensure all cabling met regulatory standards and minimized downtime during critical transitions.

## FTTH and Aerial Fiber Deployment

LCC Telecom completed a large scale FTTH and aerial fiber deployment project for a major ISP to expand broadband connectivity in a rural area. We partnered with the carrier and contractors to deliver fiber to thousands of homes and businesses in a quick time frame while maintaining minimal disruption to our client and local communities.

## Municipal Broadband Planning

LCC Telecom partnered with a municipality to design and engineer a fiber backbone to connect public facilities and provide municipal broadband to its residents. Our team created a phased deployment plan, permit packages, and a detailed technical design to support long-term network expansion.

## MDU Fiber Deployment

LCC Telecom recently completed a large-scale MDU fiber deployment project for a major ISP that brought fiber connectivity to residents in hundreds of apartment units and commercial spaces. We provided end-to-end engineering services, from initial network design to field verification, ensuring a seamless and efficient deployment.

