# OSP Drafter

## LCC Telecom

Plainfield, IL

Full-time

Remote Friendly

## Job Description

LCC Telecom is looking for an OSP Drafter to join our team! In this role, you will be responsible for creating and maintaining construction drawings and technical documentation for outside plant (OSP) fiber network projects. You will work closely with our design engineers and project managers to develop accurate, compliant, and permit-ready construction drawings that support project delivery.

**Responsibilities:**

* Create and revise OSP construction drawings using AutoCAD and other CAD tools
* Develop permit packages including splice diagrams, strand assignments, and placement plans
* Interpret GIS data and engineering designs to produce CAD-ready construction drawings
* Coordinate with engineers and project managers to ensure drawings meet client specifications
* Maintain drawing logs and version control for all project documentation
* Support permitting workflows by producing compliant and accurate documentation

**Requirements:**

* Proficiency in AutoCAD (required)
* Experience with GIS tools such as ArcGIS, QGIS, or similar platforms
* Familiarity with OSP fiber network design and construction standards
* Ability to interpret and translate GIS data into CAD drawings
* Attention to detail and commitment to accuracy in technical documentation
* Experience with permit documentation and construction drawing packages

## Benefits

* Competitive salary and benefits
* Remote work opportunities
* Professional development and training opportunities
* Collaborative and innovative work environment

</tool_call>

