# Senior OSP Design Engineer

# LCC Telecom

Plainfield, IL

Full-time

Remote Friendly

## Job Description

LCC Telecom is seeking an experienced Senior OSP Design Engineer to join our growing team. In this role, you will lead the design of complex fiber optic outside plant networks, mentor junior engineers, and serve as a technical resource for challenging projects. You will work with GIS platforms, CAD tools, and industry-standard design software to deliver high-quality engineering solutions for major telecom carriers.

**Responsibilities:**

* Lead the design of fiber optic OSP networks, including aerial, underground, and conduit-based systems
* Develop detailed engineering designs using GIS-based tools (IQGeo, 3GIS, Katapult, ArcGIS) and CAD software (AutoCAD)
* Produce and review construction drawings, permit packages, and technical specifications
* Coordinate with field engineers, project managers, and client representatives to meet project requirements
* Ensure designs comply with industry standards, client specifications, and regulatory requirements
* Mentor and support junior engineers and designers
* Participate in project planning, scoping, and estimation activities

**Requirements:**

* Minimum of 5 years' experience in Outside Plant (OSP) fiber design
* Experience with fiber network design platforms such as IQGeo, 3GIS, Katapult Pro, or similar GIS-based tools
* Proficiency in AutoCAD or similar CAD tools
* Strong understanding of OSP construction standards and industry best practices
* Experience with permit packages and construction documentation

